OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order delegation arrives at
OL,4,AHillsborough Castle for talks with SoS
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the Portadown district of
OL,7,Fthe Orange Order have arrived at
OL,8,FHillsborough Castle for further talks
OL,9,Fon the Drumcree parading dispute.
OL,11,FThe delegation included Nigel Dawson,
OL,12,FOrange Order district master in
OL,13,FPortadown, and loyalist activist Jamie
OL,14,FBryson who has been acting as their
OL,15,Flegal adviser.
OL,17,FThey made no comment to reporters as
OL,18,Fthe group walked through the gates of
OL,19,Fthe castle grounds.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
