OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order delegation arrives at
OL,4,AHillsborough Castle for talks with SoS
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth the Orange Order and the Garvaghy
OL,7,FRoad Residents' Coalition (GRRC) were
OL,8,Fgiven a document during separate
OL,9,Fmeetings with Secretary of State Sir
OL,10,FChris Bryant on Wednesday.
